WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Two agents are working on API pagination.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The API agent proposes changing the response.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The client agent reads it and flags a dependency.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
They agree to keep the existing endpoint.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The client agent picks up the new endpoint.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
They update the API and client.
